Usage: agent-deck group move <session-id> <group>
       agent-deck group move <group> --to-profile <name> [--force]

Move a session to a different group (default form), or migrate every
session in <group> to another profile's DB (with --to-profile).

Arguments:
  <session-id>   Session title, ID prefix, or path
  <group>        Target group path (or, with --to-profile, the source group)

Options:
  -force
    	With --to-profile: migrate even if a session is running
  -json
    	Output as JSON
  -q	Minimal output (short)
  -quiet
    	Minimal output
  -to-profile string
    	Migrate every session in <group> to another profile's DB (issue #928)

Examples:
  agent-deck group move my-project work/frontend
  agent-deck group move my-project ""              # Move to root
  agent-deck group move my-project root            # Move to root
  agent-deck group move work/api --to-profile march
